<item><title>Eswatini coaches face decade-long CAF A licence gap</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-coaches-face-decade-long-caf-a-licence-gap-666d2a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-coaches-face-decade-long-caf-a-licence-gap-666d2a/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>Eswatini has not offered the CAF A coaching licence since 2017, leaving local coaches unable to meet new continental standards.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 02:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" length="32835" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
